# RunnablePrompter.#promiseAuthPrompt behavior in mailnews/base/src/MsgAsyncPrompter.sys.mjs

Adapts the first listener's callback interface to a Promise. The executor calls onPromptStartAsync with onAuthResult mapped to resolve and rejects synchronous exceptions. A returned promise from the listener is ignored.

## State read

- listener.onPromptStartAsync

## State changed

None recorded.

## Calls and triggers

- run calls this private method at 62. OAuth2Module listener at 430-437 starts connect; callbacks at 491-496 signal result. Calendar listener at 384-397 prompts and explicitly signals the Boolean.

## Result and consumers

Promise resolves to the value supplied to onAuthResult; IDL describes Boolean auth availability. run uses truthiness to notify consumers.

## Errors

Only synchronous invocation exceptions reject this promise. Missing callback or an ignored asynchronous rejection can leave it pending.

## Async completion

Starts listener operation immediately inside Promise executor; no timeout or cancel method. Settlement follows onAuthResult or a synchronous throw.

## Ownership and cleanup

Callback object exposes resolver and can be retained by listener; no explicit unregister/release.

